Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.45,0:00:03.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fsp7}BEFORE ALL OF THIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was a teenager when I\Nstarted this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used to sell three\Nto five shoes a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the sole\Npurpose of,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, just\Nmaking money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:09.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi guys, I'm just\Nat the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about 9:15 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And just a quick video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Koi vlog nahi, koi\Nstock update nahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just to thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank my family,\Nthank my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,thank God that they\Nhave taken me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like, five years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're at this warehouse\Nwhere in just three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,months we are numbering\Nour 4,200th pair,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is insane for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know people sell much\Nmore and much higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is just, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,a very big\Nmoment for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is where\NI realised that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,gratitude is\Nvery important.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I just want to thank\Nall of my buyers, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,everyone who has supported\Nme in this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sumit bhaiya,\Nlike, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,who has always\Nbeen there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think we're just\Ngetting started, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,just, like,\Nthank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,everyone, and\NGod is great,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I just love\Nyou all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:57.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So thank you everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and love you,\Nkeep supporting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:02.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
